        "comments": "The assembly daCreCapi1.hap1.1 is based on 42x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. A number of heterozygous inversions were recorded in this assembly. Chromosome 1 has a large heterozygous inversion from\n203.6-410.1 Mbp. There are two inversions within this inversion from\n230.9-246.1 Mbp and\n249.8-303.9 Mbp.",
